            </div>

            <style>
                details[open] summary .fa-plus {
                    display: none !important;
                }

                details[open] summary .fa-minus {
                    display: block !important;
                }

                details:not([open]) summary .fa-minus {
                    display: none !important;
                }
            </style>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <details class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden open:ring-2 open:ring-blue-600/50 open:shadow-md transition">
                    <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Why is my geyser giving electric shocks?</h3>
                        <span class="ml-4 shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 group-open:text-blue-600 transition-colors">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-minus"></i>
                        </span>
                    </summary>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed pl-1">
                        This is highly dangerous. It typically happens when the heating element ruptures and current leaks into the water, or due to improper earthing. Switch it off immediately and call us.
                    </p>
                </details>

                <details class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden open:ring-2 open:ring-blue-600/50 open:shadow-md transition">
                    <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-900 dark:text-white">How often should I service my geyser?</h3>
